  "steps": [
    "Thinly slice the cucumber and red onion, then toss them with the cider vinegar, honey and a pinch of salt. Set aside for 10 minutes so they soften and become lightly pickled.",
    "Wash and dry the rocket and lettuce, then spread them over two plates.",
    "Core and thinly slice the apple. Slice or shave the cheddar into bite-sized pieces.",
    "Toast the wholemeal bread if you like, then arrange the cheddar, apple, quick-pickled cucumber and onion on the plates.",
    "Whisk the olive oil, mustard and a pinch of black pepper together, then drizzle over the salad just before serving."
